<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43511" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔβολ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>throwing luckily</i> (with
			the dice), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μίδας ἐν κύβοισιν εὐβολώτατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eub.
					58
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				9.94
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μίδας</span>
			: generally, <i>lucky</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγρη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					3.71
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				5.18
			</span></i>. Adv., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦν γὰρ -λως
				ἔχων</span> he was <i>in luck</i>, cj. Pors. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐβούλως</span>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				696
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεσσοὶ -ώτερον πίπτοντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristaenet.
					1.23
				</span></i>
			.</div>
